  "{@0}. Jednotkový vektor $\\vec u=\\frac{\\vec v}{|\\vec v|}=\\left({@1},\\,{@2}\\right)$. $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial\\vec u}=\\nabla f\\cdot\\vec u=\\dfrac{{@3}\\cdot{@4}+{@5}\\cdot{@6}}{{@7}}={@8}$.": "{@0}。単位ベクトル $\\vec u=\\frac{\\vec v}{|\\vec v|}=\\left({@1},\\,{@2}\\right)$。$\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial\\vec u}=\\nabla f\\cdot\\vec u=\\dfrac{{@3}\\cdot{@4}+{@5}\\cdot{@6}}{{@7}}={@8}$。",
