  "h = {@0} · <span class=\"c-accent\">Euler y(2) ≈ {@1} (chyba {@2})</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">Heun y(2) ≈ {@3} (chyba {@4})</span> · presne e² = {@5}": "h = {@0} · <span class=\"c-accent\">オイラー y(2) ≈ {@1}（誤差 {@2}）</span> · <span class=\"c-ok\">ホイン y(2) ≈ {@3}（誤差 {@4}）</span> · 正確には e² = {@5}",
