  "{@0} $|(x-x_0)(x-x_1)|={@1}\\cdot {@2}={@3}$. Odhad chyby: $\\frac{{@4}}{2}\\cdot {@5}\\approx {@6}$.": "{@0} $|(x-x_0)(x-x_1)|={@1}\\cdot {@2}={@3}$。誤差の評価：$\\frac{{@4}}{2}\\cdot {@5}\\approx {@6}$。",
